response:
The report describes an ongoing phishing campaign targeting Ukrainian government organizations with email accounts in the gov.ua domain. Attackers send spoofed IT support notifications mimicking Zimbra mail servers and Zimbra Web Access login pages to harvest credentials, propagate further phishing emails from compromised accounts, and access servers from IP addresses registered in the Russian Federation.

